          "prompt": "Captain Jack Sparrow's crew fires a cannonball at 22 m/s, 25° above the horizontal, from a clifftop fort 18 m above the sea. Jack insists he was aiming at that rock. Find the time the cannonball takes to hit the water and how far from the base of the cliff it lands.",
          "selfCheck": "[  3.1 s  ·  62 m  ]",
          "solution": "Quadratic root 3.087 s; range 61.6 m.",
          "finalAnswer": "t = 3.1 s (3.087 s)   x = 62 m (61.6 m)",
          "steps": [
            {
              "row": [
                "v_{x} = 22 cos 25° = 19.94 m/s     v_{iy} = 22 sin 25° = 9.298 m/s"
